Unit tests
==========

test_utils/ covers the host-independent helpers in src/Utils/utils.cpp:
UTF-8 to ISO-8859-1 conversion, timestamp parsing, departure delay
calculation and UTC to local time conversion (including DST changes).

They run on the development machine, not on the Inkplate:

    pio test -e native

The GitHub Actions workflow in .github/workflows/build.yml runs them on
every push together with the firmware builds.
